rmacology (Berlin)</source><year>2007</year><volume>191</volume><fpage>745</fpage><lpage>758</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17265076</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00213-007-0698-y</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sarkar</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Klein</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Kruger</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Aripiprazole augmentation in treatment-refractory obsessive-compulsive disorder</article-title><source>Psychopharmacology (Berlin)</source><year>2008</year><volume>197</volume><fpage>687</fpage><lpage>688</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18264798</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00213-008-1091-1</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>